<section id="project-section" class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[16rem_1fr] items-start"><nav class="md:sticky md:top-4" aria-label="Form sections"><ol class="flex flex-col gap-1"><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/overview" class="flex flex-col rounded bg-neutral-100 px-3 py-2 font-bold focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600" aria-current="page" aria-label="Overview, 5 of 5 required"><span>Overview</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-600">5 of 5 required</span></a></li><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/dataset" class="flex flex-col rounded px-3 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600" aria-label="Dataset, 6 of 6 required"><span>Dataset</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-600">6 of 6 required</span></a></li><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/publications" class="flex flex-col rounded px-3 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600"><span>Publications</span></a></li><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/contributors" class="flex flex-col rounded px-3 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600" aria-label="Contributors, 1 of 2 required"><span>Contributors</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-600">1 of 2 required</span></a></li><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/access" class="flex flex-col rounded px-3 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600" aria-label="Access, citation and funding, 2 of 2 required"><span>Access, citation and funding</span><span class="text-xs text-neutral-600">2 of 2 required</span></a></li><li><a href="/projects/0801d/sections/image" class="flex flex-col rounded px-3 py-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-600"><span>Project image</span></a></li></ol></nav><div><div class="empty:hidden" aria-live="polite"><div class="alert alert-warning mb-4">This project is in review, so the draft cannot be changed. Nothing was saved.</div></div><h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-4">Overview</h2><form id="section-form" method="post" action="/projects/0801d/sections/overview" class="flex flex-col gap-6" data-on:submit="@post('/projects/0801d/sections/overview', {contentType: 'form'})"><div class="field"><p class="field-label">PID</p><p class="whitespace-pre-line text-neutral-900">https://ark.dasch.swiss/ark:/72163/1/0801</p><p class="field-hint">The project's persistent identifier. Assigned by DaSCH on first publication.</p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="name">Name <span class="w-fit rounded bg-warning-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-warning-800">Required</span></label><input class="field-input" id="name" name="name" type="text" value="Basler Edition der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel" aria-describedby="name-hint"><p class="field-hint" id="name-hint">Full, human-readable project title.</p><p class="field-error" id="name-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="officialName">Official name <span class="w-fit rounded bg-info-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-info-800">Recommended</span></label><input class="field-input" id="officialName" name="officialName" type="text" value="Basler Edition der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel" aria-describedby="officialName-hint"><p class="field-hint" id="officialName-hint">Official legal name of the project — the formal registered title, for example as filed with the funder. Kept for records, and not shown on the public project page.</p><p class="field-error" id="officialName-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><p class="field-label">Alternative names <span class="w-fit rounded bg-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700">Optional</span></p><p class="text-neutral-900">1 entry</p><p class="field-hint">This field is not editable here yet. Its current value is kept unchanged when you save, and the control arrives in a later release.</p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="shortDescription">Short description <span class="w-fit rounded bg-warning-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-warning-800">Required</span></label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="shortDescription" name="shortDescription" rows="2" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="shortDescription-hint">Online edition of the unpublished correspondence of the Bernoulli family, managed by the Bernoulli-Euler-Zentrum at the University of Basel.</textarea><p class="field-hint" id="shortDescription-hint">One-line teaser for cards and listings. Up to 200 characters.</p><p class="field-error" id="shortDescription-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><fieldset class="field field-group" id="description" aria-describedby="description-hint"><legend class="field-label">Description <span class="w-fit rounded bg-warning-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-warning-800">Required</span></legend><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="description.de">German</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="description.de" name="description.de" rows="5">Die Basler Edition der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel (BEBB) ist eine umfassende Online-Edition der bisher unveröffentlichten Korrespondenz der Familie Bernoulli, einer der bedeutendsten Wissenschaftsdynastien der frühen Neuzeit. Die Edition umfasst die Briefe von Daniel Bernoulli, Jacob II Bernoulli, Johann I Bernoulli, Johann II Bernoulli, Nicolaus I Bernoulli, Nicolaus II Bernoulli und Jacob Hermann. Betreut vom Bernoulli-Euler-Zentrum der Universität Basel, bietet die BEBB durchsuchbare edierte Texte, verknüpft mit Faksimiles und dem Basler Inventar der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel.</textarea><p class="field-error" id="description.de-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="description.en">English</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="description.en" name="description.en" rows="5">The Basler Edition der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel (BEBB) is a comprehensive online edition of the as-yet-unpublished correspondence of the Bernoulli family, one of the most important scientific dynasties of the early modern period. The edition covers the letters of Daniel Bernoulli, Jacob II Bernoulli, Johann I Bernoulli, Johann II Bernoulli, Nicolaus I Bernoulli, Nicolaus II Bernoulli, and Jacob Hermann. Managed by the Bernoulli-Euler-Zentrum at the University of Basel, the BEBB provides searchable edited texts linked with facsimiles and the Basler Inventar der Bernoulli-Briefwechsel.</textarea><p class="field-error" id="description.en-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="description.fr">French</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="description.fr" name="description.fr" rows="5"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="description.fr-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="description.it">Italian</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="description.it" name="description.it" rows="5"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="description.it-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div><p class="field-hint" id="description-hint">Long form — at least one language. Required before publishing.</p></fieldset><fieldset class="field field-group" id="abstract" aria-describedby="abstract-hint"><legend class="field-label">Abstract <span class="w-fit rounded bg-info-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-info-800">Recommended</span></legend><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="abstract.de">German</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="abstract.de" name="abstract.de" rows="2"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="abstract.de-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="abstract.en">English</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="abstract.en" name="abstract.en" rows="2">Comprehensive online edition of the unpublished correspondence of the Bernoulli family, providing searchable edited texts linked with facsimiles.</textarea><p class="field-error" id="abstract.en-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="abstract.fr">French</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="abstract.fr" name="abstract.fr" rows="2"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="abstract.fr-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="abstract.it">Italian</label><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" id="abstract.it" name="abstract.it" rows="2"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="abstract.it-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div><p class="field-hint" id="abstract-hint">Short, citation-ready summary.</p></fieldset><div class="field"><p class="field-label">External project website <span class="w-fit rounded bg-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700">Optional</span></p><p class="italic text-neutral-600">Not set</p><p class="field-hint">This field is not editable here yet. Its current value is kept unchanged when you save, and the control arrives in a later release.</p></div><div class="field"><p class="field-label">Status <span class="w-fit rounded bg-warning-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-warning-800">Required</span></p><p class="whitespace-pre-line text-neutral-900">Ongoing</p><p class="field-hint">This field is not editable here yet. Its current value is kept unchanged when you save, and the control arrives in a later release.</p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="startDate">Start date <span class="w-fit rounded bg-warning-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-warning-800">Required</span></label><input class="field-input" id="startDate" name="startDate" type="date" value="2016-07-01" aria-describedby="startDate-hint"><p class="field-hint" id="startDate-hint">When the project began. Required even for a draft.</p><p class="field-error" id="startDate-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="field"><label class="field-label" for="endDate">End date <span class="w-fit rounded bg-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700">Optional</span></label><input class="field-input" id="endDate" name="endDate" type="date" value="" aria-describedby="endDate-hint"><p class="field-hint" id="endDate-hint">Leave empty while the project is ongoing.</p><p class="field-error" id="endDate-error" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save draft</button><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Nothing saved yet — this form shows the project's published metadata.</p></div></form></div></section>
